Multithreading - , it is the ability of a CPU to execute multiple threads independently at the same time but share the process resources simultaneously
Thread -  simplest way to take advantage of multiple CPUs available in a machine. They share the common address space and are independent of each other.

2 ways of implementing thread:
https://chatgpt.com/c/3d5c0554-4bec-4e22-ba13-b7e5e2189efb
    1) Extending Thread
        class Demo extends Thread{
            public void run(){
                 System.out.println("Thread is running");
            }
            public static void main(String[] args){
                Demo ob = new Demo();
                ob.start();
            }

        }

    2) Implementing Runnable

         class Demo implements Runnable
         {
            public void run(){
                 System.out.println("Thread is running");
            }
            public static void main(String[] args){
                Demo ob = new Demo();
                Thread t = new Thread(ob);
                t.start();
            }

         }

